1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,126
Cannabis is designed for efficient participation, without a proof-of-work mining race

2
00:00:05,126 --> 00:00:09,320
or a competition to spend computation on new tokens.

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:15,181
The target network uses Ethereum proof-of-stake settlement. Useful computation happens separately,

4
00:00:15,181 --> 00:00:20,200
through tasks that requesters need and agree to pay for.

5
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:26,546
These tasks can include training, rendering, analysis, simulation and other software

6
00:00:26,546 --> 00:00:31,913
workloads. The aim is to put computing resources to productive use,

7
00:00:31,913 --> 00:00:34,840
with measured costs and clear results.
